- follow the instructions in rebuild_jar/README; rebuild_jar/README.jsf12 and
  rebuild_jar/README.jsf20 document the changes made for each JSF variant
- then run buildArtifact.sh to assemble the artifacts
- to rebuild the artifacts, go into the facelets-taglib-jsf12 and facelets-taglib-jsf20 directories and run 'mvn clean package'
- to publish them on Maven Central run 'mvn clean deploy' instead: this is restricted to
  Link.it maintainers, as it requires the GPG signing key and the Maven Central token
